          "english_quote": "Bounded Athos and Latin alternatives are separately disclosed in reader notes.",
          "issue": "The metadata claims disclosure that the supplied reader notes do not contain. No bounded Athos or Latin alternative wording is presented, so readers cannot identify or compare those purported alternatives.",
          "suggested_revision": "Remove this claim unless the relevant alternative wording and its provenance are supplied. Describe only the bracketed attribution and lexical alternatives actually disclosed; retain the selected working reading.",
          "severity": "major"
        },
        {
          "source_quote": "Ἄκουσον, [φησίν,]",
          "english_quote": "The working i.3 brackets he says; the 1891 apparatus calls it Harmer’s insertion supported by versions, while Lake (1907) Plate VIII lacks it. The English supplies the disclosed working attribution, not a claim of unanimous Greek.",
          "issue": "The supplied source establishes the brackets, but does not establish the assertions about Harmer, versional support, or Lake’s plate. The note presents those historical and visual-source claims categorically without supplied supporting evidence. The attribution itself is appropriately disclosed as supplied and need not be removed.",
          "suggested_revision": "Retain the directly supported disclosure: “The selected working Greek brackets ‘he says’; the English includes this bracketed attribution.” Supply an attributable apparatus excerpt and supporting transcription or image evidence for the additional claims, or explicitly identify them as unverified reports rather than established collation results.",
          "severity": "minor"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "edition": "simplified",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "checks": {
        "complete_coverage": false,
        "no_added_claims": false,
        "names_and_negations": true,
        "speaker_attribution": true,
        "source_choices_and_notes": false,
